### 1. Health Check (Opt-in Anonymous)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/health

### 2. Login with valid credentials (Opt-in Anonymous)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8000/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin"
}

### 3. Login with invalid credentials (Fails with 401)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "wrong_user",
  "password": "wrong_password"
}

### 4. General endpoint without token (Secure by default, fails with 401)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/protected

### 5. General endpoint with invalid token (Fails with 401)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/protected
Authorization: Bearer invalid-garbage-token

### 6. General endpoint with valid token from login (Succeeds with 200)
@authToken = {{login.response.body.access_token}}
GET http://localhost:8000/api/protected
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Endpoint requesting user identity with valid token (Succeeds with 200)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
